WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.761 --> 00:00:16.412
The day Aunt Polly told Pollyanna that a new doctor had been summoned.

2
00:00:16.432 --> 00:00:20.116
"Another doctor—besides Dr.

3
00:00:20.156 --> 00:00:24.059
Warren—might know of a treatment to help you get well faster."

4
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.322
Pollyanna's face lit up with joy.

5
00:00:27.342 --> 00:00:29.404
"Dr. Chilton!

6
00:00:29.964 --> 00:00:33.565
Oh, Aunt Polly, I've wanted him to visit ever since my accident.

7
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:38.446
But I was afraid you wouldn't allow that because he saw you with the rose in your hair."

8
00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:44.728
Aunt Polly's face turned white, then red, then back to white again.

9
00:00:45.949 --> 00:00:47.889
She struggled to keep her voice cheerful.

10
00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.490
"Oh, no, dear!

11
00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:51.890
I didn't mean Dr.

12
00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:55.191
Chilton. This new doctor, Dr.

13
00:00:55.331 --> 00:00:58.232
Mead, is a very famous one from New York.

14
00:00:59.232 --> 00:01:01.713
He knows a great deal about injuries like yours."

15
00:01:03.134 --> 00:01:04.515
Pollyanna's face fell.

16
00:01:04.535 --> 00:01:08.497
"I can't believe he knows half as much as Dr.

17
00:01:08.557 --> 00:01:11.359
Chilton. After all, Dr.

18
00:01:11.419 --> 00:01:12.479
Chilton treated Mr.

19
00:01:12.519 --> 00:01:13.900
Pendleton's broken leg.

20
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.162
If you don't mind, I'd prefer to have Dr.

21
00:01:17.222 --> 00:01:21.484
Chilton." "But I do mind."

22
00:01:23.025 --> 00:01:24.926
Aunt Polly straightened Pollyanna's covers.

23
00:01:24.946 --> 00:01:28.788
"I'd do almost anything for you, dear.

24
00:01:30.068 --> 00:01:33.131
However, for reasons I can't discuss, I don't want Dr.

25
00:01:33.171 --> 00:01:33.912
Chilton here.

26
00:01:35.113 --> 00:01:39.637
Besides, he can't know as much as this doctor, who's a specialist."

27
00:01:41.358 --> 00:01:42.980
Pollyanna was not ready to give up.

28
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.823
"But, Aunt Polly, if you loved Dr.

29
00:01:46.883 --> 00:01:49.065
Chilton—" "What did you say?"

30
00:01:49.806 --> 00:01:51.047
Aunt Polly looked startled.

31
00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:53.509
"If you loved Dr.

32
00:01:53.549 --> 00:01:56.832
Chilton instead of that New York doctor, you'd get better faster.

33
00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:00.282
I mean, if you were the patient, which you're not."

34
00:02:02.024 --> 00:02:03.085
Pollyanna sighed.

35
00:02:03.105 --> 00:02:07.228
"I'm just trying to say that I love Dr.

36
00:02:07.268 --> 00:02:10.711
Chilton, so he'd make me feel better faster if he came."

37
00:02:12.613 --> 00:02:14.935
Aunt Polly looked relieved when the nurse entered the room.

38
00:02:14.955 --> 00:02:19.039
"I'm sorry, Pollyanna," Aunt Polly said.

39
00:02:19.059 --> 00:02:23.122
"You must let me decide what's best for you this time.

40
00:02:24.323 --> 00:02:28.366
Besides, it's already arranged that the doctor will arrive tomorrow."

41
00:02:30.787 --> 00:02:31.988
As it happened, Dr.

42
00:02:32.048 --> 00:02:33.609
Mead did not arrive the next day.

43
00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:39.172
Aunt Polly received a telegram that he had suddenly taken ill.

44
00:02:41.053 --> 00:02:43.474
This led Pollyanna to plead again for Dr.

45
00:02:43.494 --> 00:02:47.637
Chilton. "It would be so easy for Dr.

46
00:02:47.717 --> 00:02:50.358
Chilton to come now," Pollyanna pointed out.

47
00:02:51.939 --> 00:02:53.000
Aunt Polly shook her head.

48
00:02:54.268 --> 00:03:04.277
"I'll give you anything you want but that, As the days passed, Aunt Polly did everything she could

49
00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:07.000
to please Pollyanna—except summon Dr.

50
00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:15.708
Chilton. wouldn't have believed it, if I didn't see it with my own eyes," Nancy said to Tom.

51
00:03:16.949 --> 00:03:19.652
It was early one morning, and they were having breakfast in the kitchen.

52
00:03:21.108 --> 00:03:24.311
"Miss Polly didn't used to allow the dog and cat upstairs.

53
00:03:25.352 --> 00:03:30.557
Now she lets Buffy and Fluffy tumble on the bed just because it makes Pollyanna happy."

54
00:03:35.502 --> 00:03:37.404
Tom chuckled as he sipped his coffee.

55
00:03:39.045 --> 00:03:39.986
Nancy went on.

56
00:03:40.006 --> 00:03:46.112
"When Miss Polly isn't sitting with Pollyanna, she's moving those prisms around to catch the sunlight.

57
00:03:47.868 --> 00:03:53.390
She sends for fresh flowers from a neighbor's greenhouse, and here's the most astonishing thing.

58
00:03:54.631 --> 00:04:00.493
The other day I caught the nurse fixing Miss Polly's hair while Pollyanna gave instructions.

59
00:04:02.234 --> 00:04:06.496
And Miss Polly has worn her hair that way every day just to please that child!

60
00:04:08.237 --> 00:04:11.318
She's actually almost—" "Pretty?"

61
00:04:11.678 --> 00:04:12.899
Tom finished her sentence.

62
00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:16.180
"I told you she used to be pretty.

63
00:04:17.408 --> 00:04:19.529
And I bet she doesn't look so old now."

64
00:04:19.549 --> 00:04:21.469
"That's right."

65
00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.831
Nancy went to the stove and brought Tom another pancake.

66
00:04:26.851 --> 00:04:31.552
"I still haven't figured out who Miss Polly was engaged to."

67
00:04:31.572 --> 00:04:35.973
"And you won't learn that from me!"

68
00:04:37.633 --> 00:04:39.514
Tom poured maple syrup on his pancake.

69
00:04:39.534 --> 00:04:43.735
"How is Pollyanna these days?"

70
00:04:45.956 --> 00:04:46.796
Nancy sighed.

71
00:04:48.336 --> 00:04:49.317
"There's no change.

72
00:04:50.237 --> 00:04:53.559
She just lies in bed and tries to be glad about something."

73
00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.081
Tom nodded.

74
00:04:56.101 --> 00:05:04.506
"From what I hear around town, Pollyanna has told everybody about that Glad Game her father invented."

75
00:05:04.526 --> 00:05:09.469
"Everybody but Miss Polly, who didn't want to hear anything about him.

76
00:05:10.489 --> 00:05:14.452
Pollyanna is always telling me how glad she'll be when she can go to school again.

77
00:05:16.164 --> 00:05:16.925
Or visit Mrs.

78
00:05:16.985 --> 00:05:17.745
Snow or Mr.

79
00:05:17.785 --> 00:05:20.707
Pendleton. Or ride in Dr.

80
00:05:20.767 --> 00:05:21.788
Chilton's carriage."

81
00:05:24.089 --> 00:05:26.370
Nancy stopped talking and studied her empty plate.

82
00:05:27.731 --> 00:05:30.393
When she looked up, her eyes were filled with tears.

83
00:05:30.413 --> 00:05:32.374
"Oh, Tom!

84
00:05:32.934 --> 00:05:37.117
Pollyanna doesn't realize how far in the future all this gladness is.

85
00:05:38.518 --> 00:05:42.000
And both Pollyanna and Miss Polly are getting so thin!"

86
00:05:44.149 --> 00:05:46.134
Tom drank one last swallow of coffee.

87
00:05:46.155 --> 00:05:50.367
"The sooner that New York doctor gets here, the better!"
